(DOBBLE - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Dobble has 55 round cards with 8 symbols on each. Any two cards always share exactly) Tj T*
(one symbol. Be the fastest to spot it and say its name. Several mini-games use the) Tj T*
(same cards.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE TOWER) Tj T*
(Deal one card face down to each player and put the rest face up in a pile in the) Tj T*
(center. On "go", players turn their card over. Find the symbol shared by your card and) Tj T*
(the center card, name it and take the center card onto your pile. Your top card) Tj T*
(changes each time. When the center pile is empty, the player with the most cards wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE WELL) Tj T*
(Deal all cards except one, which goes face up in the center. Players turn their pile) Tj T*
(face up. Be the first to find the symbol shared by your top card and the center card,) Tj T*
(name it and put your card on the center. The first player with no cards left wins.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
