(THE HOT POTATO) Tj T*
(Played in several rounds. Each player holds one card face down. On "go", players) Tj T*
(reveal their card in an open hand. Find a symbol shared by your card and another) Tj T*
(player's card, name it and put your card on theirs. That player now holds all those) Tj T*
(cards. The last player holding cards loses the round and keeps them. After 5 rounds,) Tj T*
(the player with the fewest cards wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE POISONED GIFT) Tj T*
(Each player gets one card face down and the rest go face up in the center. Find the) Tj T*
(symbol shared between the center card and another player's card, name it and give the) Tj T*
(center card to that player. When the pile is empty, the player with the fewest cards) Tj T*
(wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RULES FOR ALL MINI-GAMES) Tj T*
(If two players name a symbol at the same time, the first one to place the card wins.) Tj T*
(The size and color of a symbol do not matter: only its shape.) Tj T*
ET
